  "findings": [
    "Updated present configuration baseline to managedOpenSearch3.5/provider6.64.0/AWSforFluentBit3.4.15 without falsely declaring OpenSearch2.11 unsupported; its standard-support date is2027-11-07.",
    "Replaced readonly/var/logTailDB, Docker-only framing and missing metadataRBAC with explicit6-resourceLinuxcollector, separate writable state, CRI/Docker parser, nativebinary command, typelessAPI/TLS/SigV4 and pinnedimage metadata.",
    "Kept daily LogstashFormat indexing coherent with templates/ISM; separated numberedalias rollover. OpenSearch3.5RESTparser does not support max_primary_shard_size; ISMmin_primary_shard_size is different from RESTtotal max_size.",
    "Corrected managed ISM action objects, coldtimestamp and cold_delete; qualified async index-age retention and late-record/migration risks.",
    "Corrected kubernetes.namespace_name and app.* mapping/query fields, error filters and combined namespaceDLS/FLS raw-log exclusion; permissions/source trust remain explicit prerequisites.",
    "Replaced self-managed SAML YAML with AWSAPI JSON helper and separated IAM-only domain access from SAMLbrowser access; corrected snapshot schedule and logpublishing policyconditions.",
    "Provided optional Firehose configuration with explicit FailedDocumentsOnly, defined externalrole/VPC/bucket dependencies and currentservice naming; no data-delivery or engine-integration test claimed.",
    "Removed unsupported universal cost/latency/querymix/migration thresholds while describing missing originalbenchmarkconditions; retained4conceptualPNGwith accurate topology/storage/index-age captions and liveviewerlinks.",
    "Aligned20bilingualquizanswers with the revised guide and retained52legacyguideheadingaliases; all4recognizeddateheaders parsed."
  ],
